@startuml
title Focus Farm architecture

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
top to bottom direction

actor User

rectangle "Application\n----\nLauncher\nFocusFarmApp" as Application #F5F5F5
rectangle "UI (JavaFX)\n----\nMainWindow\nFarmView / PlotView\nDashboardView\nChatPanel\nCountdownRefreshCoordinator" as UI #E8F5E9
rectangle "Logic\n----\nLogicManager\nCommandParser\nFarmCommand implementations\nCommandResult / FarmEvent" as Logic #E3F2FD
rectangle "Model\n----\nFarm\nSix FarmPlot state machines\nImmutable snapshots\njava.time.Clock" as Model #FFF8E1
rectangle "Storage\n----\nFarmStorage\nJsonFarmStorage" as Storage #FCE4EC
database "data/farm.json" as FarmFile

User --> UI : enters slash commands\nand reads views
Application --> UI : creates window
Application --> Logic : creates manager
UI --> Logic : execute commands and\nrefresh countdowns
Logic --> Model : copy, query, and mutate
Logic --> Storage : load and save snapshots
Storage --> FarmFile : JSON read and replace

note right of UI
  UI views receive immutable snapshots.
  Animations are cosmetic only.
end note

note right of Logic
  A changed candidate Farm is saved
  before it becomes the live Farm.
end note

@enduml
